<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<contentList>
  <content contentuid="hf8aea69bg477ag4cc9g93f2g8ed85099c245" version="1">巨人力量</content>
  <content contentuid="h142774b2g27bag49e7g9d4egb4310691b59f" version="1">力量增加至23。10级时力量增加至27。20级时力量增加至31。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd0951908g8168g489cga307g3e1bcd9b81a2" version="1">守护之链</content>
  <content contentuid="h25064b5eg8d83g4f80g8223gfb79a9cb0af7" version="1">获得对所有伤害类型的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistance"&gt;抗性&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
  <content contentuid="hbc979f65g1220g44bag9776g97adab8a5a97" version="1">谋杀灵光</content>
  <content contentuid="h3933b2f5g2754g4beegaa86g867c8e4b17a2" version="1">在3米范围内的敌人获得穿刺易伤。可以切换开关此能力。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd05631bbg8915g4a40g8aefg063e1c49a12e" version="1">泰坦射击</content>
  <content contentuid="hce01afccge682g42c7g911dg7f25f44b7a49" version="1">你的远程武器攻击造成额外的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Strength"&gt;力量&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier"&gt;调整值&lt;/LSTag&gt;点物理伤害。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd961b2a4g52eeg44dfg91c1g2076b9e989a1" version="1">扩大伤口</content>
  <content contentuid="h580b1639gcfc6g42a6gb255g713d28c48195" version="1">打出&lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重击&lt;/LSTag&gt;时额外造成1d6点&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Force"&gt;力场&lt;/LSTag&gt;伤害。</content>
  <content contentuid="h0e6155e7g8fe2g40b2ga343g1325509e760e" version="1">悲惨重击</content>
  <content contentuid="h6a38e0cfgb8acg4ea0gbb8cgcb5cdfe60ca8" version="1">打出&lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重击&lt;/LSTag&gt;时，额外造成7点伤害。可重复学习。</content>
  <content contentuid="h90f52acfg2f5dg4582gaf2eg9fdee35c929c" version="1">致命一击</content>
  <content contentuid="h778d413cg0142g41e5g9e89g645191486c18" version="1">&lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重击&lt;/LSTag&gt;所需的点数-1。可重复学习。</content>
  <content contentuid="hdde6b8f8gf3f7g4cd5g81e9gd7cbfe304644" version="1">快手</content>
  <content contentuid="hcd3fb78cgaff7g4eebg874bgd513d6446dc9" version="1">获得一个额外的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="BonusAction"&gt;附赠动作&lt;/LSTag&gt;。可重复学习。</content>
  <content contentuid="h445cfcd8gcdf0g4c1bgbf1ag5bb6ffe8ac5f" version="1">戏法大师</content>
  <content contentuid="h8bc1ff1fge5b0g4f83g9505g87fe02e2bf58" version="1">你可以将戏法从&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Action"&gt;动作&lt;/LSTag&gt;改为&lt;LSTag Tooltip="BonusAction"&gt;附赠动作&lt;/LSTag&gt;施放。</content>
  <content contentuid="h2688be97g81b8g4175gaff4gaeedf4b03988" version="1">合群施法者</content>
  <content contentuid="headb6201g3e5fg41e2gacd0gb37fa8a3936a" version="1">戏法额外造成等同于你选择的属性调整值的伤害。被选择的属性增加1。</content>
  <content contentuid="h32cfda0dgc1a8g4813g89d0g25b6aeeaf524" version="1">合群施法者（力量）</content>
  <content contentuid="h23d592a9g3a8fg4997ga7c3g45177bd6b447" version="1">戏法额外造成等同于你的<LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier_Strength">力量调整值</LSTag>的伤害。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd854cebcge9c9g4cb8gabdbg8e051f9bb797" version="1">合群施法者（敏捷）</content>
  <content contentuid="h06b02155g7d19g45b9gb10dg0bd973caa39c" version="1">戏法额外造成等同于你的<LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier_Dexterity">敏捷调整值</LSTag>的伤害。</content>
  <content contentuid="hee63f83bg732eg4b27gb00fge4b5e9e5e088" version="1">合群施法者（体质）</content>
  <content contentuid="h76721fc7g2de0g47b9g97d3gef341effd4e0" version="1">戏法额外造成等同于你的<LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier_Constitution">体质调整值</LSTag>的伤害。</content>
  <content contentuid="hbd2dc0fag9d54g40f2gb4f0g3de869026238" version="1">合群施法者（智力）</content>
  <content contentuid="he58c3221g4e4eg426agbb1fgfe21ddebb3f5" version="1">戏法额外造成等同于你的<LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier_Intelligence">智力调整值</LSTag>的伤害。</content>
  <content contentuid="h62bdc4dag19a9g4649g810cgf8ea96022c2f" version="1">合群施法者（感知）</content>
  <content contentuid="h9d515e4ag73efg48d7ga9d8gd2cc18913730" version="1">戏法额外造成等同于你的<LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier_Wisdom">感知调整值</LSTag>的伤害。</content>
  <content contentuid="h10725b31g2fb3g4252gb34eg866046da03b2" version="1">合群施法者（魅力）</content>
  <content contentuid="ha6d94a78g4a84g4b91g95f3g3ec9f2aa7997" version="1">戏法额外造成等同于你的<LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier_Charisma">魅力调整值</LSTag>的伤害。</content>
</contentList>